+## Council Integration Summary
+
+| Source Group | Scope Tested | Prior Runs | Council Finding Count | Final Council Verdict |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| **Group 1: CPU Tensor Port & Fixed Factory** | 60 CPU / 59 Factory synthetic cases | 2 independent roots passed (exit 0) | 0 | **Accept for tested scope** |
+| **Group 2: Session Lifecycle & Result Facade** | 46 simulated cases | 2 independent roots passed (exit 0) | 0 | **Accept for tested scope** |
+| **Group 3: Owned WhisperX & Wheel Packaging** | 50 inert cases + text wheel layout | 2 independent roots passed (exit 0) | 0 | **Accept for tested scope** |
+
+All three source groups satisfy their respective design and contract specifications for their tested scopes. Native PyTorch execution, Windows filesystem exclusion, authenticated multi-process bootstrap, live model conversion, and CPU dependency resolution remain separate, ungranted stages.
